With -DWITH_DUKTAPE=OFF, DUKTAPE_FOUND is never set, and modules.cmk's
math(EXPR NUM_PACRUNNER "...+${DUKTAPE_FOUND}") fails ("0+0+0+": syntax
error).  Set it to 0 when the search is switched off.

libproxy 0.4.x is no longer developed upstream (0.5 moved to meson and
dropped the PAC runner modules, https://github.com/libproxy/libproxy), so
this is not sent upstream.

--- libproxy-0.4.18/libproxy/cmake/modules/pacrunner_duktape.cmk
+++ libproxy-0.4.18/libproxy/cmake/modules/pacrunner_duktape.cmk
@@ -17,5 +17,7 @@
       link_directories(${DUKTAPE_LIBRARIES})
       link_libraries(duktape)
     endif()
+  else()
+    set(DUKTAPE_FOUND 0)
   endif()
 endif()
